<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= choose \\* dim {number} t u. (fn : t -> option u) (s : seq dim t) : seq dim u =\n    \\ n =>\n        := ^ body fn s i i' =\n            ?= i |> s ?|\n            | None => None\n            | Some x =>\n                ?= x |> fn ?|\n                | Some x ?& n = i' => Some x\n                | Some _ => 루프 (i + 1) (i' + 1)\n                | _ => 루프 (i + 1) i'\n        :& := 루프 i i' =\n            ? n |> var_is |> not\n            ?> body fn s i i'\n            |:\n                := fn = ~~ fn\n                := s = ~~ s\n                ~~ body fn s i i'\n        루프 0 0","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := choose \* dim {number} t u. (fn : t -> option u) (s : seq dim t) : seq dim u =
      \ n =>
          := ^ body fn s i i' =
              ?= i |> s ?|
              | None => None
              | Some x =>
                  ?= x |> fn ?|
                  | Some x ?& n = i' => Some x
                  | Some _ => 루프 (i + 1) (i' + 1)
                  | _ => 루프 (i + 1) i'
          :& := 루프 i i' =
              ? n |> var_is |> not
              ?> body fn s i i'
              |:
                  := fn = ~~ fn
                  := s = ~~ s
                  ~~ body fn s i i'
          루프 0 0
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

