<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= fold fn init seq =\n    := ^ 루프 acc n =\n        ?= seq n ?|\n        | Some x => 루프 (fn acc x) (n + 1)\n        | None => acc\n    루프 init 0\n\n:= fold_ fn init seq =\n    :~ ^ 루프 acc n =\n        ?= seq n ?|\n        | Some x => 루프 (fn acc x) (n + 1)\n        | None => acc\n    루프 init 0\n\n:= sum seq =\n    seq |> fold (+) 0\n\n:= sum_ seq =\n    seq |> fold_ (+) 0","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := fold fn init seq =
      := ^ 루프 acc n =
          ?= seq n ?|
          | Some x => 루프 (fn acc x) (n + 1)
          | None => acc
      루프 init 0

  := fold_ fn init seq =
      :~ ^ 루프 acc n =
          ?= seq n ?|
          | Some x => 루프 (fn acc x) (n + 1)
          | None => acc
      루프 init 0

  := sum seq =
      seq |> fold (+) 0

  := sum_ seq =
      seq |> fold_ (+) 0
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

