<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= memoize_ seq =\n    := state = mut []\n    \\ n =>\n        ?= *state |> listm'::try_find_ (\\ (n', _) => n' = n) ?|\n        | Some (_, v) => v\n        | None =>\n            := fresh = seq n\n            state <- (n, fresh) :: *state\n            fresh\n\n:= memoize seq = memoize_ seq","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := memoize_ seq =
      := state = mut []
      \ n =>
          ?= *state |> listm'::try_find_ (\ (n', _) => n' = n) ?|
          | Some (_, v) => v
          | None =>
              := fresh = seq n
              state <- (n, fresh) :: *state
              fresh

  := memoize seq = memoize_ seq
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

#### memoize (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test --symbol\n\n:= seq =\n    \\ n => n |> print_and_return |> Some\n    |> memoize_\n\nseq\n|> take_while_ \\ n (_ : i32) => n < 5\n|> listm'::sum\n|> _assert_eq 10\n\nseq\n|> take_while_ \\ n _ => n < 5\n|> listm'::sum\n|> _assert_eq 10","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test --symbol

  := seq =
      \ n => n |> print_and_return |> Some
      |> memoize_

  seq
  |> take_while_ \ n (_ : i32) => n < 5
  |> listm'::sum
  |> _assert_eq 10

  seq
  |> take_while_ \ n _ => n < 5
  |> listm'::sum
  |> _assert_eq 10
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= iterate \\* a b {number}. (f : a -> a) (x0 : a) (num_steps : b) : a =\n    := ^ 루프 \\* c {number}. (x : a) (n : c) : a =\n        ? n <= 0\n        ?> x\n        |: 루프 (f x) (n - 1)\n    루프 x0 num_steps","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := iterate \* a b {number}. (f : a -> a) (x0 : a) (num_steps : b) : a =
      := ^ 루프 \* c {number}. (x : a) (n : c) : a =
          ? n <= 0
          ?> x
          |: 루프 (f x) (n - 1)
      루프 x0 num_steps
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

#### iterate (test)

