<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= iterate_ \\* a b {number}. (f : a -> a) (x0 : a) (num_steps : b) : a =\n    :~ ^ 루프 \\* c {number}. (x : a) (n : c) : a =\n        ? n <= 0\n        ?> x\n        |: 루프 (f x) (n - 1)\n    루프 x0 num_steps","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := iterate_ \* a b {number}. (f : a -> a) (x0 : a) (num_steps : b) : a =
      :~ ^ 루프 \* c {number}. (x : a) (n : c) : a =
          ? n <= 0
          ?> x
          |: 루프 (f x) (n - 1)
      루프 x0 num_steps
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

