<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= find_last \\* item result. fold_fn fn target : option result =\n    fold_fn (\\ (item : item) (result : option result) =>\n        ?= result ?|\n        | None => fn item\n        | result => result\n    ) target (None : option result)\n\n:= array_find_last \\* item result. (fn : item -> option result) (target : array item) : option result =\n    find_last arraym::foldBack fn target\n\n:= list_find_last \\* item result. (fn : item -> option result) (target : list item) : option result =\n    find_last listm::foldBack fn target\n\n:== seq_switch' t =\n    {\n        Gleam : $'List(`t)'\n        Fsharp : $'`t seq'\n        Python : $'list'\n        Rust : $'Rc<Vec<`t>>'\n        TypeScript : $'Array<`t>'\n        Zig : $'[]const `(t)'\n    }\n:! seq' t = $'backend_switch `(seq_switch' t)'\n\n:= length' \\* t. (items : seq' t) : int =\n    backend_switch {\n        Gleam = \\ () =>\n            global \"import gleam/list\"\n            $'!items |> list.length' : int\n        Fsharp = \\ () => items |> $'Seq.length' : int\n        Python = \\ () => $'len(!items)' : int\n        Rust = \\ () => ($'!items.len()' : convert::unativeint) |> convert::convert : int\n        TypeScript = \\ () => $'!items.length' : int\n        Zig = \\ () => $'@@as(`int, @@intCast(!items.len))' : int\n    }\n\n:= to_list' \\* t. (items : seq' t) : listm'::list' t =\n    backend_switch {\n        Gleam = \\ () => $'!items ' : listm'::list' t\n        Fsharp = \\ () => items |> $'Seq.toList' : listm'::list' t\n        Python = \\ () => $'!items ' : listm'::list' t\n        Rust = \\ () => $'(!items).clone()' : listm'::list' t\n        TypeScript = \\ () => $'[...!items]' : listm'::list' t\n        Zig = \\ () => $'!items ' : listm'::list' t\n    }\n\n:= new_seq \\* t. fn : seq' t =\n    backend_switch {\n        Gleam = \\ () =>\n            $'!fn()' : seq' t\n        Fsharp = \\ () =>\n            \\ () =>\n                $'seq {'\n                fn |> indent\n                $'}' : ()\n            |> let'\n            |> \\ x => x : seq' t\n        Python = \\ () =>\n            $'list(!fn())' : seq' t\n    }","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := find_last \* item result. fold_fn fn target : option result =
      fold_fn (\ (item : item) (result : option result) =>
          ?= result ?|
          | None => fn item
          | result => result
      ) target (None : option result)

  := array_find_last \* item result. (fn : item -> option result) (target : array item) : option result =
      find_last arraym::foldBack fn target

  := list_find_last \* item result. (fn : item -> option result) (target : list item) : option result =
      find_last listm::foldBack fn target

  :== seq_switch' t =
      {
          Gleam : $'List(`t)'
          Fsharp : $'`t seq'
          Python : $'list'
          Rust : $'Rc<Vec<`t>>'
          TypeScript : $'Array<`t>'
          Zig : $'[]const `(t)'
      }
  :! seq' t = $'backend_switch `(seq_switch' t)'

  := length' \* t. (items : seq' t) : int =
      backend_switch {
          Gleam = \ () =>
              global "import gleam/list"
              $'!items |> list.length' : int
          Fsharp = \ () => items |> $'Seq.length' : int
          Python = \ () => $'len(!items)' : int
          Rust = \ () => ($'!items.len()' : convert::unativeint) |> convert::convert : int
          TypeScript = \ () => $'!items.length' : int
          Zig = \ () => $'@@as(`int, @@intCast(!items.len))' : int
      }

  := to_list' \* t. (items : seq' t) : listm'::list' t =
      backend_switch {
          Gleam = \ () => $'!items ' : listm'::list' t
          Fsharp = \ () => items |> $'Seq.toList' : listm'::list' t
          Python = \ () => $'!items ' : listm'::list' t
          Rust = \ () => $'(!items).clone()' : listm'::list' t
          TypeScript = \ () => $'[...!items]' : listm'::list' t
          Zig = \ () => $'!items ' : listm'::list' t
      }

  := new_seq \* t. fn : seq' t =
      backend_switch {
          Gleam = \ () =>
              $'!fn()' : seq' t
          Fsharp = \ () =>
              \ () =>
                  $'seq {'
                  fn |> indent
                  $'}' : ()
              |> let'
              |> \ x => x : seq' t
          Python = \ () =>
              $'list(!fn())' : seq' t
      }
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

#### new_seq (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test --symbol\n///> fsharp\n///> cuda\n\n\\ () =>\n    \"a\" |> yield\n    \"b\" |> yield\n|> new_seq\n|> to_list'\n|> listm'::unbox\n|> _assert_eq [ \"a\"; \"b\" ]","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test --symbol
  ///> fsharp
  ///> cuda

  \ () =>
      "a" |> yield
      "b" |> yield
  |> new_seq
  |> to_list'
  |> listm'::unbox
  |> _assert_eq [ "a"; "b" ]
  """,
