)
```

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= of_array' \\* t. (items : array t) : seq' t =\n    backend_switch {\n        Gleam = \\ () => $'!items |> spiral_array_to_list' : seq' t\n        Fsharp = \\ () =>\n            \\ () =>\n                $'for i = 0 to !items.Length - 1 do yield !items.[i]'\n            |> new_seq\n            |> \\ x => x : seq' t\n        Python = \\ () => $'[item for item in !items]' : seq' t\n        Rust = \\ () => $'Rc::new(!items.borrow().clone())' : seq' t\n        TypeScript = \\ () => $'[...!items]' : seq' t\n        Zig = \\ () => $'!items ' : seq' t\n    }","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := of_array' \* t. (items : array t) : seq' t =
      backend_switch {
          Gleam = \ () => $'!items |> spiral_array_to_list' : seq' t
          Fsharp = \ () =>
              \ () =>
                  $'for i = 0 to !items.Length - 1 do yield !items.[i]'
              |> new_seq
              |> \ x => x : seq' t
          Python = \ () => $'[item for item in !items]' : seq' t
          Rust = \ () => $'Rc::new(!items.borrow().clone())' : seq' t
          TypeScript = \ () => $'[...!items]' : seq' t
          Zig = \ () => $'!items ' : seq' t
      }
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

