<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= to_array' \\* t. (items : seq' t) : array t =\n    backend_switch {\n        Gleam = \\ () => $'!items |> spiral_array_from_list' : array t\n        Fsharp = \\ () => items |> $'Seq.toArray' : array t\n        Python = \\ () =>\n            := x = ($'!items ' : listm'::list' t) |> listm'::to_array'\n            $'!x ' : array t\n        Rust = \\ () => $'Rc::new(RefCell::new((*!items).clone()))' : array t\n        TypeScript = \\ () => $'[...!items]' : array t\n        Zig = \\ () => $'(spiral_gpa.dupe(`t, !items) catch @@panic(\"out of memory\"))' : array t\n    }","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := to_array' \* t. (items : seq' t) : array t =
      backend_switch {
          Gleam = \ () => $'!items |> spiral_array_from_list' : array t
          Fsharp = \ () => items |> $'Seq.toArray' : array t
          Python = \ () =>
              := x = ($'!items ' : listm'::list' t) |> listm'::to_array'
              $'!x ' : array t
          Rust = \ () => $'Rc::new(RefCell::new((*!items).clone()))' : array t
          TypeScript = \ () => $'[...!items]' : array t
          Zig = \ () => $'(spiral_gpa.dupe(`t, !items) catch @@panic("out of memory"))' : array t
      }
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

