<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":! fuse t =\n    `(\n        rust::rust_type\n            `($'core_iter_Fuse<`t>')\n            `($'core::iter::Fuse<`t>')\n            \"type core_iter_Fuse<'T> = class end\"\n    )","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  :! fuse t =
      `(
          rust::rust_type
              `($'core_iter_Fuse<`t>')
              `($'core::iter::Fuse<`t>')
              "type core_iter_Fuse<'T> = class end"
      )
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```
